bugsplat-apple provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-bugsplat CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::bugsplat::bugsplat)

find_package also sets BUGSPLAT_FRAMEWORK_DIR to the BugSplat.framework
bundle, which has to be embedded in the application, along with
BUGSPLAT_FRAMEWORK_DSYM_DIR for its separated symbols and BUGSPLAT_TOOLS_DIR for
the symbol upload helpers.
